WEBVTT

00:04.210 --> 00:07.240
The magic survival game went on forever.

00:05.830 --> 00:10.970
Here I go! I'm gonna drink!

00:07.240 --> 00:09.370
It took an entire day.

00:09.370 --> 00:12.020
Every coven was impressive to watch.

00:10.970 --> 00:14.760
Join me, y'all!

00:12.020 --> 00:14.760
Professor Deneb is the only one left.

00:14.760 --> 00:17.500
The students must be sleeping 
like logs right now.

00:17.500 --> 00:21.080
Actual combat is way more 
exhausting than any practice.

00:21.080 --> 00:26.190
It's been a while since our 
cohort got together for a drink.

00:26.190 --> 00:29.480
How old were you when you 
were hired again, Claude?

00:29.480 --> 00:30.570
Seventeen.

00:30.570 --> 00:31.570
So young!

00:31.570 --> 00:35.530
A professor at seventeen? 
You're an exception among exceptions.

00:35.530 --> 00:38.150
And you became first-class 
while you were still a student.

00:38.150 --> 00:40.050
You sure are something else.

00:40.050 --> 00:41.520
It's starting to piss me off.

00:41.520 --> 00:43.940
It's in the past. It doesn't matter.

00:43.940 --> 00:45.490
It matters.

00:46.270 --> 00:48.360
You still haven't told us

00:48.880 --> 00:54.490
why you fled from Diana
when the cultists attacked.

00:54.870 --> 00:57.650
Even after the school faculty
and the royal army

00:57.650 --> 01:02.300
suppressed the cultists, 
you never returned.

01:02.830 --> 01:05.080
I was convinced you were dead.

01:05.410 --> 01:08.220
But two years later, you came back.

01:08.750 --> 01:11.360
Isn't it about time you 
told us what happened?

01:14.660 --> 01:16.420
That day, I...

01:16.420 --> 01:17.920
Yoohoo!

01:17.920 --> 01:19.840
Are y'all drinking?

01:19.840 --> 01:21.290
Drink up, Prof!

01:21.290 --> 01:23.060
Drink! Drink!

01:24.840 --> 01:26.620
Professor Polaris...

01:27.140 --> 01:30.310
How about you cut back 
on the drinking, yeah?

01:31.430 --> 01:32.810
I like those eyes!

01:32.810 --> 01:34.770
Belittle me more!

01:34.100 --> 01:35.770
I can't with this woman!

01:35.770 --> 01:37.580
You deal with her, Pro-whatsyourface!

01:37.580 --> 01:40.040
It's Procyon! We're colleagues!

01:41.610 --> 01:44.380
I think the moment to ask is gone.

03:15.690 --> 03:17.920
The last day of camp.

03:18.410 --> 03:20.880
Well done, everyone.

03:20.880 --> 03:23.520
Professor Deneb's so cute.

03:23.520 --> 03:26.480
What are we doing for our final training?

03:26.480 --> 03:27.980
Get off me!

03:27.980 --> 03:30.970
I can't move. All my muscles are hurting.

03:31.260 --> 03:34.180
Now, everyone, please undress.

03:41.940 --> 03:45.320
I wouldn't have thought our final 
day would be a health check.

03:45.320 --> 03:47.150
She is a health teacher, after all.

03:47.150 --> 03:48.650
Pretty anticlimactic, huh?

03:49.510 --> 03:51.060
Was that from the exam room?!

03:51.060 --> 03:52.420
That was Ewe's voice.

03:53.130 --> 03:54.330
She's back.

03:54.330 --> 03:55.720
Is she all right?

03:57.620 --> 03:59.390
I'm full of energy!

03:59.390 --> 04:01.590
Muscle aches all gone-gone!

04:01.590 --> 04:02.710
For real?

04:02.710 --> 04:05.080
Is it just me, or has 
her personality changed?

04:06.040 --> 04:08.090
I feel great!

04:08.090 --> 04:10.690
The whole world is so colorful! Oh, yeah!

04:10.690 --> 04:12.300
Thank you, Earth!

04:12.300 --> 04:14.790
Next, Spica Virgo.

04:14.790 --> 04:16.690
This is an exam, right?!

04:16.690 --> 04:18.680
What's going on in there?!

04:19.230 --> 04:22.220
Now, I'm going to check your health

04:22.220 --> 04:25.900
and treat the injuries and 
fatigue from your time at camp.

04:25.900 --> 04:28.520
You can do that?

04:28.520 --> 04:29.560
Yes.

04:29.560 --> 04:34.200
My Taurus Magic lets me strengthen 
other people's bodies.

04:34.200 --> 04:39.240
I can activate your cells to improve your 
natural healing and physical abilities.

04:40.110 --> 04:42.520
Goddess of healing, Eir.

04:44.150 --> 04:49.570
I wonder if her healing magic 
is like my Rebirth Magic.

04:51.470 --> 04:54.690
It tingles, like there's energy 
running through my body.

04:54.690 --> 04:57.280
I'm starting to feel warm.

04:57.890 --> 05:00.100
My muscles are relaxing.

05:00.100 --> 05:02.610
All the tension in my body is easing.

05:02.970 --> 05:06.150
I feel like I'm a bubble, melting away.

05:06.150 --> 05:08.710
This feels great!

05:13.440 --> 05:15.210
There, all done.

05:15.210 --> 05:17.430
You're in good health.

05:17.430 --> 05:19.290
That felt great!

05:19.290 --> 05:21.440
I'm brimming with strength.

05:21.440 --> 05:22.740
That's good to hear.

05:23.050 --> 05:23.710
Though...

05:23.710 --> 05:26.880
You'll be in a trance-like 
state for a while.

05:24.050 --> 05:28.470
I believe I can fly! I believe 
I can soar! Fly away!

05:29.330 --> 05:31.180
I can't believe this girl

05:31.180 --> 05:34.240
Who needs a broom anyway?!

05:31.880 --> 05:37.140
didn't have so much as a scrape 
after that grueling camp.

05:37.760 --> 05:41.140
Something felt off when I saw 
the magic power in her body, too.

05:41.140 --> 05:45.160
Like there's some other magic 
coursing through her.

05:45.900 --> 05:47.980
Just who is she, anyway?

05:48.310 --> 05:49.560
I am God!

05:49.560 --> 05:51.950
The heavens and earth are mine to control!

05:53.200 --> 05:57.420
After three long days, 
we finally got all the stamps!

05:57.420 --> 05:59.370
Camp's over!

05:59.370 --> 06:01.880
I can't wait to sleep in my own bed.

06:01.880 --> 06:04.250
Have we really gained any strength?

06:04.250 --> 06:06.310
I doubt we'll notice it immediately.

06:06.690 --> 06:09.300
I'm never going to any 
training camps again.

06:09.300 --> 06:11.640
Good work everyone. Truly.

06:11.640 --> 06:14.420
All right, everyone, we're going home.

06:14.420 --> 06:16.180
Load your stuff onto the train.

06:16.180 --> 06:17.350
Okay.

06:17.950 --> 06:19.630
Hey, Professor.

06:20.720 --> 06:23.610
I made it through the whole camp.

06:23.610 --> 06:25.580
You're welcome to praise me.

06:26.100 --> 06:28.360
Why should I have to praise you?

06:28.360 --> 06:30.290
But I worked so hard!

06:30.290 --> 06:33.280
I'll give you all the praise 
if you pass the finals.

06:33.280 --> 06:35.130
Don't forget you said that!

06:35.130 --> 06:39.220
Those two seem awfully close, don't they?

06:39.220 --> 06:40.260
Maybe they're going out?

06:40.260 --> 06:43.620
What?! S-Student-and-instructor 
relationships are forbidden!

06:44.050 --> 06:45.790
Let's go load up our stuff, Spica.

06:45.790 --> 06:46.830
Hana?

06:46.830 --> 06:49.030
You pervert prof!

06:49.030 --> 06:51.560
Huh? Does she hate me?

06:51.560 --> 06:52.590
Let's go!

06:52.590 --> 06:54.510
Okay, sure.

06:54.510 --> 06:55.640
Huh?

06:55.640 --> 06:56.850
What's wrong?

06:58.060 --> 06:59.830
My luggage is missing.

06:59.830 --> 07:01.290
Want us to help you find it?

07:01.290 --> 07:04.060
Nah, I'll go check my room.

07:04.060 --> 07:06.030
I'll catch up with all of you.

07:06.030 --> 07:08.040
The train leaves in ten minutes.

07:08.040 --> 07:10.110
We're leaving you behind 
if you don't make it.

07:10.110 --> 07:12.000
Crap! I gotta hurry!

07:15.760 --> 07:19.220
I couldn't find it in the lodge.

07:19.220 --> 07:22.150
Maybe someone took it by accident.

07:24.180 --> 07:25.890
That's my luggage!

07:25.890 --> 07:27.640
Why is it out there?!

07:29.310 --> 07:31.680
Jeez. Who pranked me?

07:32.250 --> 07:35.640
I hope my stuff is all right.

07:37.320 --> 07:38.620
Good day.

07:40.450 --> 07:43.390
Who's she? When did she get here?

07:44.200 --> 07:46.770
Hello. Are you from nearby?

07:47.910 --> 07:49.320
Goodness, no.

07:49.320 --> 07:51.750
Who would live this deep 
in the mountains?

07:52.230 --> 07:53.480
She's cute.

07:53.480 --> 07:55.490
She's like a doll.

07:55.490 --> 07:58.290
I'm the one who threw out your stuff.

08:00.750 --> 08:03.050
Wh-What for?

08:04.280 --> 08:06.380
"What for?"

08:07.150 --> 08:10.370
So that I could abduct you, Spica.

08:13.510 --> 08:14.470
Anima!

08:19.060 --> 08:22.990
I was hoping I wouldn't have to 
do this in such a roundabout way,

08:22.990 --> 08:24.560
but Rigel is so cautious.

08:24.850 --> 08:25.990
My voice!

08:25.990 --> 08:29.170
I'd love to behead you right now, in fact,

08:29.170 --> 08:33.020
but he wants me to bring you 
in alive, so I'm holding back.

08:33.410 --> 08:35.230
Aren't I a good girl?

08:35.620 --> 08:37.290
What's wrong with her?

08:37.290 --> 08:38.950
Why is she doing this to me?

08:38.950 --> 08:40.720
Oh, that's right.

08:40.720 --> 08:43.170
I haven't introduced myself yet.

08:44.800 --> 08:47.080
I'm Arc Turus.

08:49.300 --> 08:53.810
I'll be taking your Rebirth Magic.

09:00.130 --> 09:02.090
My Rebirth Magic?

09:03.070 --> 09:05.150
What are you going to do with me?

09:05.150 --> 09:07.790
Oh? You can speak already?

09:07.790 --> 09:10.580
So much for my snakies' venom.

09:10.580 --> 09:13.740
That magic of yours really is impressive.

09:14.140 --> 09:17.550
I'm going to take you to 
the Order's headquarters.

09:17.550 --> 09:19.930
I won't hurt you as long 
as you don't resist.

09:20.440 --> 09:22.410
Why would you even bother?

09:22.780 --> 09:26.760
Rebirth Magic just makes me recover 
a little faster than normal.

09:26.760 --> 09:28.980
It's just something like 
healing magic, isn't it?

09:30.630 --> 09:34.010
Please don't compare it to such a toy.

09:34.010 --> 09:38.160
You don't understand the 
value of your power, do you?

09:38.970 --> 09:43.810
There's only one person in the 
world who can use Rebirth Magic.

09:43.810 --> 09:46.270
Use it correctly, and you 
can even overthrow nations.

09:46.270 --> 09:48.200
It's magic that can make you a god.

09:48.200 --> 09:50.950
Overthrow nations? How would you—

09:53.340 --> 09:55.180
I don't like noisy people.

09:55.180 --> 09:56.860
Shut up for a second.

10:00.190 --> 10:01.820
The train's leaving.

10:01.820 --> 10:03.020
Nice.

10:03.020 --> 10:05.160
No one will get in my way now.

10:05.160 --> 10:08.920
I'd hate to have to 
deal with the teachers.

10:09.250 --> 10:14.030
I've been waiting so long for the 
moment I could get you alone.

10:15.810 --> 10:17.230
I'm scared.

10:17.230 --> 10:18.870
I can't breathe.

10:18.870 --> 10:20.340
I'm gonna die!

10:20.340 --> 10:21.950
Ooh.

10:21.950 --> 10:23.470
I love that face.

10:23.470 --> 10:25.050
It gives me shivers.

10:25.340 --> 10:29.040
I'm supposed to bring you back alive,

10:29.040 --> 10:32.640
but I guess your Rebirth Magic can 
fix you up even if you suffocate?

10:35.550 --> 10:37.890
Oh, no...

10:38.320 --> 10:40.680
My vision's going blank.

10:41.280 --> 10:44.660
I'm blacking out.

10:44.660 --> 10:46.380
Scorpion Magic!

10:52.250 --> 10:53.280
Who are you?

10:53.280 --> 10:55.060
That's my line!

10:55.060 --> 10:56.670
What are you doing to Spica?!

10:59.600 --> 11:01.390
Spica! Hang in there!

11:02.590 --> 11:06.300
You wouldn't come back, 
so we came looking for you.

11:06.300 --> 11:07.560
Are you all right?

11:07.560 --> 11:10.170
Professor?

11:10.170 --> 11:11.750
What happened to you?

11:11.750 --> 11:13.260
Who is she?

11:13.820 --> 11:16.640
I don't know what's going on, either.

11:16.640 --> 11:20.820
But she said she's after my Rebirth Magic.

11:23.990 --> 11:27.180
Why aren't you all on the train?

11:27.180 --> 11:30.490
What? As if we'd leave our friend behind.

11:30.490 --> 11:32.160
Is that so hard for you to understand?

11:32.430 --> 11:34.210
Would you mind getting out of my way?

11:34.570 --> 11:39.040
I need to take the girl, or Rigel 
is going to be upset with me.

11:39.390 --> 11:42.920
I'm working so hard. 
Wouldn't you feel bad for me?

11:42.920 --> 11:44.690
Don't play games.

11:44.690 --> 11:47.680
That mark you have... 
You're a cultist, aren't you?

11:47.680 --> 11:49.300
A cultist?!

11:49.300 --> 11:52.790
She's with the terrorists that 
attacked Diana two years ago!

11:52.790 --> 11:56.270
We can't let her get close to Spica, then.

11:57.890 --> 11:59.220
"Cultist"...

11:59.220 --> 12:01.640
I hate it when you call us that.

12:02.200 --> 12:03.710
You simply...

12:05.360 --> 12:09.040
don't understand the high 
philosophy of the Black Serpent!

12:09.040 --> 12:10.780
Ophiuchus Magic!

12:14.600 --> 12:15.990
What is that move?!

12:17.490 --> 12:19.050
Ophiuchus Magic?

12:19.620 --> 12:21.480
What is this black snake?

12:21.480 --> 12:23.770
I've never seen magic like this!

12:28.400 --> 12:29.680
Professor...

12:29.680 --> 12:31.280
Good job, servant!

12:31.280 --> 12:33.890
Use your first-class power 
to blow her to pieces!

12:34.690 --> 12:36.240
That snake...

12:36.240 --> 12:38.480
It drew the life out of the flowers.

12:38.480 --> 12:40.520
This is forbidden magic.

12:41.340 --> 12:44.700
I need to defeat her before 
my magic power runs out.

12:44.700 --> 12:46.880
"Professor," huh?

12:47.400 --> 12:48.950
So you're still at it?

12:49.350 --> 12:50.660
"Still"?

12:57.080 --> 13:00.180
Do you remember me?

13:03.080 --> 13:04.320
Arc...

13:07.440 --> 13:09.720
No... It can't be.

13:09.720 --> 13:11.550
You know her?

13:13.470 --> 13:15.070
Arc Turus.

13:15.390 --> 13:17.480
Formerly of Claude Coven.

13:18.720 --> 13:20.470
My student.

13:21.550 --> 13:25.980
But why would your student...

13:26.650 --> 13:29.560
How long are you gonna 
keep up the teacher act?

13:30.000 --> 13:32.860
My place isn't at Diana anymore.

13:33.310 --> 13:36.760
I have someone else instructing me now.

13:36.760 --> 13:39.580
He's annoyingly strict and naggy.

13:40.060 --> 13:42.610
But Rigel's really strong.

13:42.610 --> 13:45.290
He could easily throw 
down with a first-class.

13:48.120 --> 13:51.010
You talk too much, Arc.

13:52.140 --> 13:53.190
When did he get here?!

13:53.190 --> 13:54.400
No...

13:54.400 --> 13:57.170
How could he catch our 
professor off-guard?!

13:57.170 --> 14:03.360
I wanted to keep things simple, but 
those heathens who oppose our wishes

14:03.360 --> 14:08.270
must be exterminated in the 
name of our lord, Asclepius.

14:08.570 --> 14:10.080
Goodbye.

14:13.480 --> 14:14.570
He vanished.

14:14.570 --> 14:15.780
Professor, you're bleeding!

14:15.780 --> 14:16.850
I'm fine.

14:16.850 --> 14:18.290
But where is he?

14:20.150 --> 14:21.450
Good grief.

14:21.450 --> 14:23.630
This has become quite a mess.

14:23.630 --> 14:29.420
Arc, this is all because you didn't 
take Spica Virgo more quickly.

14:29.420 --> 14:31.090
It's not my fault.

14:31.290 --> 14:35.310
You wasted time tormenting 
your target again, didn't you?

14:36.310 --> 14:40.820
You need to become more detached,
or you'll never complete your missions.

14:40.820 --> 14:43.140
Blah, blah, groan, groan.

14:40.820 --> 14:43.140
Don't lecture me in the middle of this!

14:43.140 --> 14:45.390
Well, no matter.

14:45.850 --> 14:48.850
After all, Claude's just the man who was

14:48.850 --> 14:51.830
defeated by the Black Serpent 
two years ago.

14:52.120 --> 14:54.770
His students aren't any more capable.

14:54.770 --> 14:57.860
There's no reason to 
waste any more time here.

14:57.860 --> 15:00.090
Let's clean this up quickly.

15:00.090 --> 15:03.080
Ophiuchus Magic: Shadow Snake.

15:03.080 --> 15:04.400
He disappeared again!

15:08.090 --> 15:10.050
Gotcha!

15:10.790 --> 15:12.630
I see through that magic already!

15:13.210 --> 15:14.850
Sagittarius Magic!

15:15.540 --> 15:16.800
Professor!

15:18.880 --> 15:19.870
Glare!

15:20.260 --> 15:23.700
He seems to be able to travel 
freely through shadows.

15:23.700 --> 15:25.870
How are we supposed to stop him?

15:25.870 --> 15:27.610
Are you all right, Professor?

15:28.470 --> 15:32.580
The professor's already 
used magic several times.

15:32.580 --> 15:35.290
Even without it being Grand 
Magic, if he keeps this up,

15:35.290 --> 15:37.860
he'll run out of magic power 
and turn back into a cat.

15:37.860 --> 15:40.590
You all look so worried.

15:40.590 --> 15:42.110
I've really lost respect, huh?

15:42.410 --> 15:43.730
Don't worry.

15:44.390 --> 15:46.210
I won't let anyone die.

15:46.210 --> 15:47.940
R-Right.

15:49.000 --> 15:51.810
Impressively quick reaction.

15:51.810 --> 15:54.970
It shows that you truly 
care about your students.

15:54.970 --> 15:57.790
And your students, so roused and inspired!

15:57.790 --> 16:00.050
Such beautiful love between 
master and apprentice!

16:00.340 --> 16:03.770
I seem to have misjudged you.

16:04.350 --> 16:08.410
Your love, which drives you to 
sacrifice yourself for your students,

16:08.410 --> 16:10.990
is like that of a mother.

16:10.990 --> 16:12.730
The embodiment of a holy man!

16:12.730 --> 16:15.690
You are the ideal instructor!

16:17.890 --> 16:22.670
I'm in love with all of you.

16:24.620 --> 16:26.050
Uh-oh.

16:26.050 --> 16:28.460
They've become his new favorite.

16:28.460 --> 16:31.970
No one can stop Rigel 
when he's so infatuated.

16:32.320 --> 16:35.080
Claude's whole coven 
is truly done for now.

16:35.430 --> 16:36.800
Pardon me.

16:36.800 --> 16:40.240
I can't help but be drawn to such 
things as love and friendship.

16:40.950 --> 16:42.700
You could call it a yearning.

16:42.700 --> 16:46.480
But the world is filled 
with lies and deceit.

16:46.480 --> 16:48.940
So let me test you.

16:48.940 --> 16:53.250
Can you truly sacrifice yourself 
to protect your students?

16:53.660 --> 16:55.840
What is he talking about?

16:55.840 --> 16:57.360
What a creep.

17:04.170 --> 17:05.580
Now...

17:05.580 --> 17:11.080
Let me behold the finest 
of bonds, Mr. Claude!

17:11.490 --> 17:16.040
Ophiuchus Grand Magic: Beelzebub Serpent!

17:21.810 --> 17:24.220
Wh-What is this freak?!

17:27.650 --> 17:28.630
Chiron!

17:28.630 --> 17:29.350
Professor!

17:30.420 --> 17:31.780
Stay alert.

17:31.780 --> 17:33.920
It has teeth all over its body.

17:33.920 --> 17:36.460
Get too close, and it'll mince you.

17:39.400 --> 17:41.760
It's about to attack in a wide area.

17:41.760 --> 17:43.610
Is it planning to wipe 
out the entire forest?!

17:44.150 --> 17:47.290
Sheesh. You're one to talk 
about being detached.

17:47.290 --> 17:49.820
You're flipping out more than anyone.

17:49.820 --> 17:51.580
The boss was right.

17:52.560 --> 17:57.560
Rigel is usually a gentleman 
and a capable teacher of magic.

17:57.560 --> 18:02.380
But he has a tendency to fixate on 
love and friendship and the like.

18:02.380 --> 18:05.860
You should stay away 
from him when he does.

18:06.300 --> 18:07.550
How come?

18:07.980 --> 18:11.530
Once, in order to test his family's bonds,

18:11.530 --> 18:16.810
he used magic to murder them 
and consume their flesh.

18:17.280 --> 18:19.440
That's insane. Yikes.

18:19.440 --> 18:22.100
It may not make sense to us,

18:22.100 --> 18:26.810
but that is his way of 
confirming his relationships.

18:27.910 --> 18:31.060
I've ended up with one 
nutcase of an instructor.

18:31.540 --> 18:35.870
But I can't help but admire his abilities.

18:39.850 --> 18:42.290
Capella, do you have a plan?

18:42.570 --> 18:43.560
It's over...

18:43.560 --> 18:47.760
We don't have a chance 
against this level of power.

18:49.650 --> 18:52.010
Help me, Professor!

18:52.010 --> 18:54.220
Sagittarius Grand Magic...

18:54.980 --> 18:57.180
Dragon Bow: Tornado Arrow!

18:59.380 --> 19:01.610
Marvelous, Claude!

19:04.010 --> 19:06.030
You'd target me, too?

19:15.670 --> 19:18.220
Are you all okay?

19:18.220 --> 19:19.350
Professor!

19:19.580 --> 19:22.100
We did it! They're gone!

19:22.100 --> 19:23.430
Did that blow them away?

19:23.430 --> 19:26.110
I-I thought we were dead.

19:26.110 --> 19:27.620
That was amazing...

19:27.620 --> 19:30.250
So that's how first-class 
magicians do battle.

19:30.250 --> 19:32.310
Thank you so much, Professor!

19:32.570 --> 19:33.510
No...

19:33.900 --> 19:36.030
It's not over yet.

19:36.300 --> 19:38.500
They won't go down so easily.

19:39.830 --> 19:45.840
Still, I had to use my Grand Magic 
to protect my students.

19:45.840 --> 19:48.480
That's just how strong they are.

19:49.210 --> 19:51.690
Everyone, listen up.

19:51.690 --> 19:53.170
We don't have time.

19:53.170 --> 19:56.660
Run down the mountain as fast 
as you can and call for help.

19:56.980 --> 19:59.400
They'll be back in no time.

19:59.910 --> 20:02.010
Don't let yourselves be caught!

20:02.010 --> 20:04.220
B-But...

20:04.600 --> 20:06.350
I believe in you.

20:07.670 --> 20:10.300
What are you talking about?! You're...

20:12.530 --> 20:13.830
So bright.

20:13.830 --> 20:15.480
What is it this time?

20:21.660 --> 20:23.500
H-He turned into a cat?!

20:23.500 --> 20:24.800
What's going on?

20:24.800 --> 20:27.050
Is this the enemy's magic, too?

20:27.050 --> 20:29.190
Is the professor okay?

20:29.190 --> 20:30.300
I don't know.

20:30.300 --> 20:32.410
We need to get him treated quick.

20:32.410 --> 20:34.130
Th-The professor is—

20:34.130 --> 20:36.630
Shit! What the hell?!

20:36.630 --> 20:39.260
Why is this happening to us?

20:39.260 --> 20:40.250
Chiron...

20:40.860 --> 20:44.740
Can we get away from them on our own?

20:48.350 --> 20:51.260
I'm too terrified to move.

20:51.570 --> 20:54.730
Is this the fear of death?

20:56.140 --> 20:58.390
I'm sorry, everyone.

20:58.390 --> 21:00.340
It's my fault you're 
all caught up in this.

21:00.820 --> 21:02.440
It isn't your fault, Spica!

21:02.920 --> 21:04.070
But...

21:04.970 --> 21:06.740
I believe in you.

21:10.520 --> 21:12.640
We can't just stand here.

21:12.640 --> 21:15.750
We have to use the opportunity 
the professor gave us.

21:16.270 --> 21:20.410
And Professor Claude would never say 
something was possible if it wasn't.

21:20.410 --> 21:23.870
Which means we have what 
it takes to escape!

21:23.870 --> 21:27.820
So let's all work together 
to get through this!

21:33.030 --> 21:34.100
You're right.

21:34.100 --> 21:36.270
Your hand's shaking.

21:36.270 --> 21:39.010
I let myself be shaken.

21:39.010 --> 21:42.090
I wanna get home alive and 
have lots of good food!

21:42.090 --> 21:42.900
Let's do this!

21:43.410 --> 21:47.050
Go, Claude Coven!

21:48.190 --> 21:53.170
And so began the students' 
fight for their lives.

23:25.280 --> 23:27.950
Those guys fought like monsters.

23:27.950 --> 23:29.910
Are we really going to 
make it out without help?

23:29.910 --> 23:31.010
Don't be afraid, Chiron.

23:31.010 --> 23:32.580
I shall protect you!

23:32.580 --> 23:33.670
I'm not scared!

23:33.670 --> 23:34.850
Want me to hold your hand?

23:34.850 --> 23:36.550
Stop treating me like a kid!

23:36.470 --> 23:39.880
EPISODE 11
TARF'S PURPOSE, CHIRON'S RESOLVE

23:36.550 --> 23:39.540
Next episode: 
"Tarf's Purpose, Chiron's Resolve."
